{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Seek to create a new defence treaty for Europe",
        "additional_details": "We believe the United States will not be capable of defending both Europe and the Far East for much longer, as the P.R. China is now becoming too strong. And we feel the current US administration has shown a willingness to renege on its international agreements.\r\n \r\nWe believe only a democratically legitimate treaty could replace NATO and no current European institution is capable. The EU & UK already have many times the population and GDP of Russia. We believe only the political will is needed.",
        "background": "We call on the UK Government to propose a new European defence treaty to ensure collective security for Europe in the event of US withdrawal from, or failure to uphold, the North Atlantic Treaty. This would also provide an alternative option to any European nation that did not wish to be a US ally.",
